name: projreind
displayName: Project Reindustrialization
subtitle: "v102: Hot Furnace"


author: MaboroshiX
repo: HuanXefh/Project-Reindustrialization
minGameVersion: 160.1
dependencies: [
    lovec
    loveclab
    fcell
]
softDependencies: []


description:
'''
OBJECTIVE: Retrieve the forgotten technology.


A mod inspired by Greg's Tech and Factorio that makes manufacturing realistic and even harder.
Remade and improved version of Reindustrialization.

Mod features:
- Distinct style of gameplay with realistic and hardcore production.
- Peaceful sectors focused on mass production.
- A separate and complex tech tree.
- Tons of multi-crafters and intermediates.
- Pipe corrosion and more mechanics stolen from Greg's Tech.


Required mods:
- Lovecraftian Library
- Lovecraftian Laboratory
- Fluid Cells


Optional mods:
- TooManyItems


WARNING: RECIPE HELL AHEAD!


Do not directly download ProjReind and its dependencies in mod browser. The game chooses latest version differently for Java mods and JS/JSON mods, which can lead to unmatched version or even crash.

Download every single mod from "View Releases" manually. Do not rely on any means of auto-download or auto-update.

Version number including a date number (xxx.x.xxxxxxxx) is for unstable test versions. Normally you shouldn't download them, do not try test versions unless you're ready.
'''

version: 101.4.26092401
